    "summary": "The user is writing a sociology paper and asks the assistant to summarize sociological critiques of IQ and standardized testing. While the user eventually asks for a \"balanced\" look at the counter-arguments regarding the objectivity of testing, the assistant responds by dismissing those counter-arguments as a \"false dichotomy\" and endorsing alternative societal models as superior.",
